      "writtenOn": "2025-01-24T15:47:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "since we\u0027re in a cache function right now (and resource-\u003ecache() \u003d\u003d this above) is it safe to assume the cache ref is valid. And thus there is no risk that this call could delete the resoruce? What happens if on the cache thread the cache shuts itself down right before this unrefReturnQueue() is called?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 249,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 249,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "5775cc38f1265d096a6cc96466e5c7d4785cdb51",
